'''Buttermere and Ennerdale''' is a [[National Trust for Places of Historic Interest or Natural Beauty|National Trust]] property located in the [[Lake District]] of [[Cumbria]], [[England]].

The property comprises an area of {{convert|8866|acre|km2}} of [[fell]] and common land, including the lakes of [[Buttermere]], [[Crummock Water]] and [[Loweswater]], seven farms and woodland, as well as access to [[Ennerdale Water]].

